{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311100","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1631110001:1":{"text":"But now we'll let it \"hang\". Don't trap the sound in your throat, or you'll tire yourself out.","source_cn":"不过我们现在要把它“挂”起来，别把声音堵在喉咙里，那样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F21D5BFED4555E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631110002:0":{"text":"I... I don't understand.","source_cn":"我……我不明白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64FDBDEE13D08264","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631110003:1":{"text":"Heh. Try imagining the feeling of a yawn.","source_cn":"呵呵，你可以尝试一下打哈欠的感觉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD1CA2F9EE2EE76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631110004:1":{"text":"Haaa—","source_cn":"哈啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BB19A61862BE1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631110005:1":{"text":"Yes. Feel how your mouth opens, how the soft palate lifts? Hold that feeling, and try again.","source_cn":"对，感受一下那个口腔内部打开、软腭抬起来的感觉了吗？用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C0A5C1710D73B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631110006:1":{"text":"La, la...","source_cn":"啦啦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AF2B67194FD67D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1631110007:1":{"text":"Oh! Much better this time. Practice for a bit.","source_cn":"噢，这次感觉更好了。你先练习一会吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD4B7C8DAC6FB8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1631110007":{"text":"Oh! Much better this time. Practice for a bit.","source_cn":"噢，这次感觉更好了。你先练习一会吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD4B7C8DAC6FB8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631110008:1":{"text":"Yes. When I was alive, I was a vocal instructor.","source_cn":"是的。在我生前，曾是一位声乐老师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C693B6BA1BB55FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1631110009:1":{"text":"Singing talent is ultimately a gift from above. To meet a student as gifted as Christine... For any teacher, it's like discovering a shining treasure.","source_cn":"而歌唱天赋，终究是天赐的礼物。能遇到克莉丝汀这样天赋极...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1ABE0A89AA0F912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1631110010:1":{"text":"With proper guidance, I believe she'll one day dazzle all of Esperia.","source_cn":"我相信，只要经过恰当的引导，她一定会在伊索米亚大放异彩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x096036604829D20B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"Is she your student?","source_cn":"她是你的学生吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x95A2A0C0F20CA08E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Is she your student?","female":"Is she your student?","variant_male_record_index":"84971","variant_female_record_index":"84972","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"Are you the teacher here?","source_cn":"你是这里的老师？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x168BAEE3C893E7B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are you the teacher here?","female":"Are you the teacher here?","variant_male_record_index":"84973","variant_female_record_index":"84974","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:幽灵男子":{"text":"Ghostly Man","source":"幽灵男子","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:唱歌的女子":{"text":"Singing Woman","source":"唱歌的女子","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}